-// Class descriptions
-STRINGTABLE
-BEGIN
-    1046                    "Warriors can be found at the front of any battle, contesting toe-to-toe with monsters and villains."
-    1047                    "Archers are skillful bowyers. They keep their distance and kill monsters from afar."
-    1048                    "Mages are masters of manipulating forces and essences invisible to other human beings. This is a tool as effective as a hammer against demons."
-    1049                    "Monks are spiritual fighters who excel at all kinds of combat, with the exception of magic."
-    1050                    "Rogues are swashbucklers, bandits, thieves and marauders. The loot is everything that is of a value to them."
-    1051                    "Savages are strong, well built and excel at combat like few others. They lack discipline, but compensate for that with raw power."
-
-    1052                    "The Warrior is a champion and brawler who lives or dies by the knowledge of weapons and tactics. Classic fighter. Master of blocking."
-    1053                    "The Inquisitor has dedicated his life to finding and eliminating heresy, practitioners of evil magic and cleansing the darkness with holy fire. Master of elemental damage."
-    1054                    "Guardian is a defensive class that uses large swords and hammers. And crossbows. When asked about his mission in Tristram, he quickly changes subject."
-    1055                    "The Templar is a holy man and a noble warrior, who has taken a vow to defend the weak and fight evil. Specializes in eradication of Undead. Can use throwing hammers."//"The Knight has devoted his life to defending the innocent people from the darkness. He specializes in tactical combat and shield usage."
-
-    1056                    "The Archer's talent lies in dealing quick damage from a safe distance. But she must be careful and not let anyone close. That often doesn't end well."
-    1057                    "Scout doesn't crit with arrows but makes up for it with extra elemental arrow damage. This is where she truly shines. She also has nice-looking red hair."
-    1058                    "Sharpshooter is a slower type of archer, she has a unique assortment of long bows, and can deliver quite a punch. Her accuracy is unparalleled. And crits are deadly."
-    1059                    "The Trapper deploys traps to fight the minions of darkness. She also has a highly developed sense of fashion. Her favourite color is blue. Don't ask why."
-
-    1060                    "The Mage is a classical caster, wizard, sorcerer. He also gains access to Arcane knowledge that no other class does."
-    1061                    "The Elementalist has a knack for spells of fire, cold and lightning. A master of elements. His spells have a decent chance to inflict extra damage."
-    1062                    "Summoners are a subtype of mages who fight evil with the help of creatures they raise."
-    1063                    "The Warlock is an adept of dark knowledge and uses black sorcery and acid spells to fight demons. Cannot learn Holy spells."
-
-    1064                    "Classic Monk. Fast, versatile, and a sworn enemy of all demons. Uses staff masterfully. Can hit multiple targets with it. Prefers bows for ranged combat."
-    1065                    "A true master of weapons, the Kensei is a force to be reckoned with. And a sight to behold in battle. He believes that killing is a form of art."
-    1066                    "The Shugoki is a giant, heavily armored fighter who prefers polearms for close encounters. And bows for ranged fighting."
-    1067                    "Shinobi prefers getting close and personal with his target, and spent the life perfecting the skills of a shadow fighter. Can use throwing stars in ranged combat."
-
-    1068                    "Rogue is a dual wielding nimble character. Her strong sides are fast attacks, decent spellcasting and evasion. Her weak side is her lack of physical toughness."
-    1069                    "The Assassin uses claws in combat. She loves to dip these in acid to inflict more damage on unsuspecting victims. For ranged combat she mostly prefers throwing knives."
-    1070                    "Her armor is her weapon. She has armor pieces covered with spikes and deals damage to melee attackers this way. Uses fast crossbows for ranged combat."
-    1071                    "Life is simple for the Bombardier. She loves explosions. And she throws explosive flasks at her enemies until they all die. Usually, in terrible agony."
-
-    1072                    "Savage, a typical frontline fighter. Doesn't know how to hit a weak spot, but knows how to hit hard. Prefers large two-handed weapons."
-    1073                    "In a civilized society, Berserker's rage would be a problem. But here it's a huge advantage! A ruthless, fast and unstoppable fighter."
-    1074                    "A freak of nature, a giant of a man, he doesn't use human armor - they just don't make it his size. Can rip apart anything, with bare hands. Gives demons nightmares."
-    1075                    "Taught by the past arena experience, these men now use their skills against demons who have taken over Tristram."
-
-    1076                    "Demonologist summons demons from all circles of Hell to do his bidding. His favorite part is watching his pets tear apart everything in their path."
-    1077                    "Necromancer never hurt a living creature. All the hurt, pain and death is inflicted by his un-living sadistic horde of skeletal minions for him. It's a living."
-    1078                    "Beastmaster is a witch doctor using visceral beasts of nature to fight the darkness. Likes ripping out hearts of his fallen victims and eating them to gain their power."
-
-    1079                    "Knows how to pierce through the thickest of armor. Effective with sharps when fighting Undead. Additional shield attacks increase his damage."
-    1080                    "Purely defensive type of gladiator. Tough, powerful, unbreakable. Knows how to wear out the opponent before finishing them off."
-    1081                    "Unequaled in onslaught, he sacrifices defense for attacking. Specializes in dual weapon fighting style. A true star of pit fights."
-    1082                    "The Secutor is a gladiator that specializes in evading attacks and ultra-fast hit recovery. Curiously, he uses a semi-heavy equipment."
-
-END
